  "Q00614_SlayTheEnemyCommanderVarka/31377-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00614_SlayTheEnemyCommanderVarka/31377-06.html",
   "quest": 614,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: I await the news of your victory! You are very brave! Kill Tayre, the commander of the Ketra forces and bring back his head!",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; NOT (st.isCond(2) && st.hasQuestItems(TAYR_HEAD))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-03.htm",
   "quest": 612,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: Excellent! Raid the advance base of Ketra Orcs and kill as many as you can! Bring back their molars as proof of victory. Bring back 100 of them and I'll give you a prize of valor!",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-06.html",
   "quest": 612,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: The fight continues! Onward to victory!",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-07.html",
   "quest": 612,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: Excellent job, my friend! Today's was a stellar victory! You're our hero! You shall be well rewarded! At one time, this Buffalo horn was given only to soldiers of our tribe. It's quite valuable! You could trade it for something you really need!",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I want to go back to the battlefield.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs 31377-06.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs",
     "event": "31377-06.html",
     "quest": 612,
     "to": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-06.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I have more molars.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs 31377-07.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs",
     "event": "31377-07.html",
     "quest": 612,
     "to": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-07.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-07.html",
      "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-08.html"
     ],
     "effect": "reward"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I want to quit.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs 31377-09.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs",
     "event": "31377-09.html",
     "quest": 612,
     "to": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-09.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-08.html",
   "quest": 612,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: Didn't I ask for at least 100 molars of Ketra Orcs! Return to the battlefield now!",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00612_BattleAgainstKetraOrcs/31377-09.html",
   "quest": 612,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: Even an invincible warrior must rest occasionally! You've done a noble service! Come back when you're rested!",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00613_ProveYourCourageVarka/31377-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00613_ProveYourCourageVarka/31377-04.htm",
   "quest": 613,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: Do you truly believe you can kill Hekaton? This will be the ultimate test of your courage! Kill that filthy hero of the Ketra Orcs and cut off his head! But you mustn't forget, he's a formidable enemy! Even the best warrior is made more formidable with trusted friends fight…",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00613_ProveYourCourageVarka/31377-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00613_ProveYourCourageVarka/31377-07.html",
   "quest": 613,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: Is this the head of the beast who spilt gallons of our tribe's blood? Excellent! You're a true soldier! You've proven your valor! Dear friend of Varka, please accept this Feather of Valor.",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00614_SlayTheEnemyCommanderVarka/31377-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00614_SlayTheEnemyCommanderVarka/31377-04.htm",
   "quest": 614,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: Are you ready? You've already defeated Hekaton, hero of the Ketra, you should be able to defeat Tayre as well! Tayre is the commander of Ketra forces. He's a typical savage, little more than a beast! He has cruelly massacred hundreds of Varka soldiers! He must be stopped! K…",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00614_SlayTheEnemyCommanderVarka/31377-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00614_SlayTheEnemyCommanderVarka/31377-07.html",
   "quest": 614,
   "text": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai: Is this the Head of Tayre? Ugly bastard, wasn't he? I'm very proud of you! Take this Feather of Wisdom in recognition your outstanding military achievements. This is the Feather of Wisdom. It's the custom of the Varka to give this to the our most respected friends! Congratu…",
   "header": "Chief Ashas Varka Durai",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
